{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13422","headline":"释奠日国学观礼闻雅颂 · 令狐峘","name":"释奠日国学观礼闻雅颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"肃肃先师庙，依依胄子羣。\n满庭陈旧礼，开户拜清芬。\n万舞当华烛，箫韶入翠云。\n颂歌清晓听，雅吹度风闻。\n澹泊调元气，中和美圣君。\n唯余东鲁客，蹈舞向南熏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"令狐峘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13422.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13422","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}